Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.00,kanojo staff,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(300,300)\blur4}本字幕由悠哈璃羽字幕社制作  仅用于日语交流使用 \N请勿私自二次上传及用作商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:12.00,kanojo staff,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(300,300)\blur6}翻译：浅默  yukinesnow  校对：N0K1   时轴：涅普顿\N   后期：Aer  压制：Kappa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.22,0:00:19.50,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,本应该成为公爵的罗伯特·温奈特
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.79,0:00:20.96,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,却因为事故而死
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.70,0:00:25.18,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,孤身一人的罗伯特的母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:27.29,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,也就是温奈特家的女主人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:29.15,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,把爵位交给自己的外甥
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.15,0:00:31.72,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,也就是第二王子努尔  之后就离开了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.46,0:00:35.04,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,所以只有罗伯特的名字留在了墓地上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.62,0:00:39.26,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,努尔把那枚玉玺埋在了墓里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:43.53,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,而那个地方是努尔和贝阿特丽丝…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.16,0:00:50.88,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,贝阿特丽丝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.45,0:00:59.12,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H42484B&\blur4\4c&H000000&}Save my world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:01.87,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H7E8086&\blur4}革命のゲーム
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.12,0:01:04.54,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H42484B&\bord0}差し出す一手が勝負
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.79,0:01:05.46,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H42484B&\bord0}You ready？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.46,0:01:07.08,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H42484B&\bord0}準備はOK？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.64,0:01:25.14,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}迷宮なこの世界に
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.14,0:01:27.15,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}蔓延る駒を
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.15,0:01:29.69,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}If I could burn it all down
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.69,0:01:32.82,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}出口は見つからない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.82,0:01:35.49,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}深く祈る想いは
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.49,0:01:38.03,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}どこに消えていくの
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.03,0:01:39.87,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\1c&HFFFFFF&}Pray all night long
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.87,0:01:42.12,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\1c&HFFFFFF&}聞こえてますか？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.24,0:01:44.37,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\1c&HEFF1EA&\bord0}Black & White
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.37,0:01:47.75,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}マス目の上で微笑む
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.75,0:01:53.38,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}描くの最高のフィナーレ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.38,0:01:56.17,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}Survive my world
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.67,0:01:59.18,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\1c&HEFF1EA&\bord0}革命のゲーム
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:01.80,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}差し出す一手が勝負
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.80,0:02:03.97,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}才能で勝利を呼ぶ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.97,0:02:06.68,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\1c&HEFF1EA&\bord0}Save my life
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:09.31,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H6E7381&\bord0}片道のレール
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.65,0:02:12.07,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H36373A&\blur4}後悔なんて知らない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.23,0:02:14.32,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}何度だって試して
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.82,0:02:17.11,kanojo op jp,,0,0,0,,{\&H828487&\bord0}完璧にチェックメイト
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.45,0:00:59.12,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}Save my world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:01.87,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H7E8086&\blur4}这是革命的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.12,0:01:04.54,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H42484B&\bord0}胜负在此一举
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.79,0:01:05.46,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H42484B&\bord0}You ready？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.46,0:01:07.08,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H42484B&\bord0}你准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.64,0:01:25.14,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}在谜团重重的此世之中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.14,0:01:27.15,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}将横行的棋子落下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.15,0:01:29.69,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}If I could burn it all down
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.69,0:01:32.82,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}寻觅不见出口
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.82,0:01:35.49,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\1c&HEFF1EA&\bord0}深切祈求的心愿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.49,0:01:38.03,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}到底消失去了哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.03,0:01:39.87,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\1c&HFFFFFF&}Pray all night long
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.87,0:01:42.08,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\1c&HFFFFFF&}你是否能听见
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.24,0:01:44.37,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\1c&HEFF1EA&\bord0}Black & White
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.37,0:01:47.75,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}在棋盘格上微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.75,0:01:53.38,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}绘出的是最激烈的终局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.38,0:01:56.17,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}Survive my world
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.67,0:01:59.18,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\1c&HEFF1EA&\bord0}这是革命的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:01.80,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}胜负在此一举
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.80,0:02:03.97,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}靠才能召唤胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.97,0:02:06.68,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\1c&HEFF1EA&\bord0}Save my life
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:09.31,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H6E7381&\bord0}这是单程的轨道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.65,0:02:12.07,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H36373A&\blur4}不知后悔为何物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.23,0:02:14.32,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\1c&H36373A&\blur4}三番五次地尝试
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.82,0:02:17.11,kanojo op cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}完美地checkmate
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.60,0:02:24.36,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我们的婚约  要解除吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.96,0:02:26.24,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,不应该这么做吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.47,0:02:31.44,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,议会顺利结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:36.38,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,所以你也不会被那女人拿玉玺的事情威胁了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.41,0:02:42.36,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你和未婚妻的私人问题已经解决了  不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.05,0:02:45.10,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,维持这婚约  还有什么意义
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.61,0:02:47.79,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,然后就是解除婚约关系  一切就结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.32,0:02:53.18,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你也不想这桩契约结婚  迟迟不能结束吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.32,0:02:58.40,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我还不能解除婚约
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.91,0:02:59.42,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.38,0:03:04.46,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,莱利娜作为我的未婚妻  还有事情需要做
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.36,0:03:08.11,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.58,0:03:12.59,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你也真是  在那方面不开窍啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.72,0:03:13.90,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,您指的是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.54,0:03:17.40,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,贝…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.25,0:03:21.53,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,找我有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.84,0:03:36.00,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.13,0:03:40.35,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,不好意思  我好像认错人了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.52,0:03:43.48,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,不是贝阿特丽丝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.96,0:03:46.76,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,在小说中  会期结束的前一天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.07,0:03:50.00,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,贝阿特丽丝本应来这个墓地的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.73,0:03:52.59,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,然而  她并没有来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.34,0:03:55.77,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,意思是她再也不会来这里了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.35,0:03:58.67,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,那样的话  就是因为我…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.02,0:04:00.91,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,因为我活下来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.29,0:04:03.36,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,因为我改变故事走向了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:08.09,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,不介意的话  请坐这吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.85,0:04:15.53,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,谢谢您
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.23,0:04:18.19,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.56,0:04:20.33,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,别客气  请坐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.97,0:04:21.96,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.81,0:04:27.85,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,酒？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:31.42,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,时隔很久回来看看友人的墓
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.69,0:04:33.28,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,才发现朋友的墓消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.85,0:04:38.06,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,只剩下这瓶本想与他共饮的酒了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.36,0:04:43.08,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,这也是某种缘分吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:45.13,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,一起喝点怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.47,0:04:50.44,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,稍微喝一点  或许反倒能平复心情
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.42,0:04:52.97,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,您的朋友是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.56,0:04:55.98,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,他叫罗伯特·温奈特
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.24,0:04:58.91,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,他是罗伯特的朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.50,0:05:02.04,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,那消失的墓也就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.70,0:05:09.61,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,没了  罗伯特的墓被…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.37,0:05:13.50,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,玉玺…玉玺在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.64,0:05:17.18,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,他是个好人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.44,0:05:20.40,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,但他还没还上欠我的钱  就英年早逝了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.34,0:05:23.71,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,温奈特家的人  竟然会欠钱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.95,0:05:25.47,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,很不可置信吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.20,0:05:28.76,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,其实借钱没还的人  没准是我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.40,0:05:32.92,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,为什么温奈特家的墓突然就
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.38,0:05:36.99,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,而且话说回来  玉玺现在在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.58,0:05:39.77,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我刚才问了守墓的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.31,0:05:43.39,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,好像发生过盗墓事件
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.33,0:05:49.15,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,所以墓全都被搬到温奈特家的管辖领地里了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:50.88,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,盗墓事件？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.93,0:05:53.85,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,是没在小说中出现过的情节
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:56.17,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,这也是因我而改变的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.18,0:05:58.28,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.65,0:06:00.72,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,所谓盗墓只是个借口
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.89,0:06:02.22,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,真正的目的是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.60,0:06:07.76,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,把墓地搬走  更换藏在其中的  玉玺的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.16,0:06:15.00,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,那里埋葬着  你去世的表兄弟罗伯特骑士吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.13,0:06:19.63,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,果然  一切都是我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.92,0:06:21.24,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,酒的味道还可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.79,0:06:27.98,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,是的  很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.71,0:06:30.99,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,奇怪的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.42,0:06:32.86,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,明明我们才刚认识
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.04,0:06:35.05,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,简直就像旧识一般
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:36.80,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,是恋人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.76,0:06:40.28,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你把我误认成
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:42.84,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你的恋人了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.97,0:06:55.48,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,他一定觉得我是想追随逝世的恋人一同而去…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:59.10,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,所以才让我喝点酒平静一下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.88,0:07:03.29,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,不是的  不是您所想的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.79,0:07:06.56,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,那就是家人或者朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.44,0:07:14.73,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,因为我的出现
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:18.04,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,本来应该来这里的人却没有来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.40,0:07:24.89,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,因为我  本应要相遇的两个人没能遇到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.61,0:07:27.02,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你的意思是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.47,0:07:31.23,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你和一个已有心上人的男人有战略婚姻？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.37,0:07:35.18,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,诶？啊…大概就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.22,0:07:38.17,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,也大致差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.57,0:07:41.16,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,然后另一位已有恋人的女性
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.16,0:07:43.68,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,本应在今天来到这里是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.48,0:07:45.12,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.48,0:07:52.35,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,也就是说那位女性和你的未婚夫  正准备见一面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.86,0:07:56.00,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,是  但这事终究没有实现
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.84,0:07:57.69,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.90,0:08:02.64,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你为什么要做这种事情呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.56,0:08:07.00,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我总觉得是自己的错
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.07,0:08:08.57,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,事实上也是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.34,0:08:11.07,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,他们两人无法相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.18,0:08:15.15,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,说到底也是他们自己的命运  不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.13,0:08:19.39,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我虽然不知道你和你的未婚夫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.39,0:08:22.48,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,跟他的那位恋人发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.20,0:08:26.32,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,但自己的人生  需要自己来负责
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.32,0:08:29.10,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你不这么觉得吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.63,0:08:31.55,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,自己负责…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.96,0:08:37.18,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你就按照自己心中所想活下去比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.84,0:08:42.51,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,自己的爱情和命运  是别人无法掌控的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.65,0:08:49.32,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你有短命之相啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.14,0:08:53.04,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我说过的吧  这就是命运
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.63,0:08:59.84,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,所以我现在才依靠自己开辟自己的人生道路
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.75,0:09:04.33,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,很有说服力呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.58,0:09:08.86,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,是吧  爱是种虚幻的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.53,0:09:12.01,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,毕竟也有国王发誓自己的爱是永恒的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.84,0:09:15.63,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,然后却换了十多个王妃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.82,0:09:24.32,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,来到这个世界之后  除了努尔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.32,0:09:27.63,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我还是第一次见到这么帅的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.17,0:09:37.24,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,哎呀  一不小心耽误了你这么长时间
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.61,0:09:42.27,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你家在哪  我送你回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.41,0:09:45.76,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,不用了  我是骑马来的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.32,0:09:47.28,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.92,0:09:52.78,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,果然陌生男子送你到家门口  还是不方便呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.39,0:09:55.85,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,是啊  很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.87,0:10:01.61,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,今天非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.19,0:10:03.29,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.28,0:10:20.72,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,有着那么漂亮的未婚妻
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.05,0:10:22.59,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,还有其他的心上人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.98,0:10:26.75,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,虽然不知道他是谁  真是个有福气的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.56,0:10:31.85,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,对了  我还没问她叫什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.80,0:10:35.18,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,算了  可能也不会再遇到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.54,0:10:41.00,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我明天议会后再来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.42,0:10:42.00,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.68,0:10:44.44,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,您多注意身体
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.88,0:10:46.81,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你也是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.22,0:10:53.28,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,多关心关心吧  你的未婚妻
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:02.59,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,莱利娜…吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.96,0:11:09.96,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我得见她一面才行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.20,0:11:18.65,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,他什么都没变啊  从以前开始就是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.97,0:11:20.76,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我全部都看穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.47,0:11:30.81,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,所以那天也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:34.20,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,哥哥他…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.75,0:11:39.04,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,这下全都没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:42.06,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你什么都不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.32,0:12:01.15,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来  大小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.39,0:12:03.21,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,您到底去哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.21,0:12:04.68,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我们担心得不行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.48,0:12:08.22,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,抱歉  我的那匹马有点…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.36,0:12:16.78,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,医生！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.78,0:12:18.96,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,大小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.33,0:12:23.32,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,这是毛毯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.32,0:12:25.95,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,这是专治感冒的特调鸡尾酒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.11,0:12:29.88,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,很冷吧  我来给您暖暖手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.88,0:12:39.85,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,在这个世界我绝对是被过度保护的人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:44.38,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,突然有点不好意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.84,0:12:49.26,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,「所以墓全都被搬到温奈特家的管辖领地里了」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.98,0:12:52.16,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,怎么就没有想到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.57,0:12:57.36,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,改变墓地的位置  这是谁都能想到的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.82,0:13:00.32,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,更别说是那个努尔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.23,0:13:06.43,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,果然故事已经改变了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.76,0:13:11.45,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,贝阿特丽丝没来墓地的理由很清晰
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.91,0:13:15.53,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,因为莱利娜·麦米伦还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:19.08,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,但我还是相信着
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.76,0:13:25.55,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,那里是努尔和贝阿特丽丝的初遇之地
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.57,0:13:31.55,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,即使我还活着  贝阿特丽丝也一定会来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.76,0:13:38.33,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我已经什么都做不了了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.37,0:13:47.85,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我为了改变自己的命运  拼命努力至今
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.48,0:13:53.87,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,但我又不想改变努尔和贝阿特丽丝的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.02,0:13:58.46,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,在这个公爵府邸的人应该是贝阿特丽丝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.79,0:14:02.01,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,为什么我会在这里…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.56,0:14:07.92,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,好冷…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:09.92,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,都怪我出门没穿够
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.16,0:14:16.49,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,莱利娜  你受到了来自大神官的我的祝福
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.13,0:14:20.32,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,接下来的一年你都不用担心生病了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.97,0:14:22.99,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,真亏他敢这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.48,0:14:30.86,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,好累…就在这睡过去不好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.59,0:14:35.31,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,莱利娜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.26,0:14:38.01,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,努尔…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.13,0:14:41.26,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,听说你连入冬了都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.64,0:14:43.68,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,跑到外面玩还感冒了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.59,0:14:46.86,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,谁跟你这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.97,0:14:47.74,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.09,0:14:50.09,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,怎么可能是去玩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.56,0:14:51.47,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,那是去做什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.26,0:14:57.10,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,这全都是因为你…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.55,0:14:58.03,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.42,0:15:03.58,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,想介绍一个你本来必须要遇到的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.11,0:15:07.72,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,虽然我是你的未婚妻
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.72,0:15:10.65,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,但是我打算为你们的婚姻搭桥牵线
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.66,0:15:14.08,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,无论怎么解释都会被认为是怪人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.19,0:15:16.20,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你怎么了  给我说完啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.20,0:15:20.32,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,啊…对不起  我只是出去玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:21.72,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,药呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.52,0:15:23.45,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,已经喝了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.45,0:15:30.49,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,做什…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.80,0:15:33.39,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你身上有酒味
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.63,0:15:34.73,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,酒也喝了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.99,0:15:35.74,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,酒？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.44,0:15:38.51,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,专治感冒的特调鸡尾酒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:40.32,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,非常有效
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.46,0:15:43.36,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,噢  是吉迪恩的特调鸡尾酒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.74,0:15:46.73,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,虽然我在外面也喝了点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.64,0:15:50.43,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,所以才呆在这里挪不动？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.75,0:15:53.85,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,嗯…差不多是那样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.89,0:15:56.38,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,明明就被我一下猜中了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.11,0:16:07.77,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,啊…等…等等
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.08,0:16:09.84,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,别想太多
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.33,0:16:12.68,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你在读的那本小说里的骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.91,0:16:14.88,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,不也是这样抱着公主的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.22,0:16:18.48,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,米有人芥末嗦…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.13,0:16:21.44,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,说话都这么口齿不清了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.71,0:16:22.86,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,看来你已经完全醉了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.39,0:16:24.25,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,现在可别吐哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.81,0:16:26.03,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,才不灰吐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.12,0:16:28.44,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我葱来都没吐过
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.54,0:16:30.01,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,森莫时候有这事了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.01,0:16:31.92,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,那戈时候都素努尔滴不好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.92,0:16:33.56,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,知道了知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.80,0:16:38.72,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,为…为什么呢  是酒的原因吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.16,0:16:41.82,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,让人把墓地搬走的肯定是努尔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.49,0:16:43.82,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,也就是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.27,0:16:49.24,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我谈判的筹码其实并没有什么意义
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.98,0:16:53.56,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,但是为什么他还一直遵守着我们的契约…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.96,0:16:56.11,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,没有毁掉我们的婚约…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:20.44,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.65,0:17:21.55,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,什么奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.43,0:17:26.56,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你总是捉弄人  让人很火大
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.00,0:17:29.00,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,一直戴着面具遮掩你的内心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.76,0:17:31.44,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你不也一样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.85,0:17:32.84,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.72,0:17:38.73,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,最近觉得你变温柔了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.54,0:17:41.69,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,不奇怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.88,0:17:45.53,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我从没想过你会这么想
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.13,0:17:48.75,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,虽然只是偶尔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.04,0:17:55.77,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我们之间  已经谈崩了对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.82,0:18:02.84,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,没有继续遵守契约的必要了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.18,0:18:05.05,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,但是…为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.51,0:18:13.07,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,快睡吧  你发高烧了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.20,0:18:18.57,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我还没说完
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.64,0:18:22.19,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.77,0:18:25.34,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,最近不知道为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.51,0:18:29.58,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,开始不由自主地在意你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.65,0:18:32.64,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,跟利用价值无关
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.20,0:18:36.06,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,努尔…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.70,0:18:42.64,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,自己的爱和命运要由自己…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.80,0:18:44.38,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,啊…啊嚏！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.92,0:18:51.37,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,不行了…已经到极限了…要睡着了…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.02,0:18:55.93,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,让我来治好你的感冒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.12,0:19:01.92,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你要怎么…做…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.73,0:19:07.58,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,把感冒传给别人就是最好的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.48,0:19:17.39,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,所以…这全都怪感冒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.45,0:19:07.58,Kanojo ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(600,800)\blur5}変わりのない
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.13,0:19:13.63,Kanojo ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(600,800)\blur5}夢の続きを
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.13,0:19:20.39,Kanojo ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(600,800)\blur5}誰かの私でも
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.68,0:19:25.85,Kanojo ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(600,800)\blur5}それでも今日も息をしている
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.64,0:19:32.19,Kanojo ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)\blur5}星降る夜に流れる
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.77,0:19:39.11,Kanojo ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)\blur5}あなたは何処へ向かうの？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.40,0:19:46.70,Kanojo ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)\blur5}物語にはない　終わらない運命が
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.45,0:19:52.00,Kanojo ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)\blur5}叶うのなら
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.50,0:20:00.72,Kanojo ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)\blur5}Always and Forever
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.72,0:20:08.31,Kanojo ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)\blur5}ただ　生きるの
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:16.82,Kanojo ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)\blur5}揺れた灯りが儚く消える前に
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.15,0:20:22.78,Kanojo ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)\blur5}遠く　遠く　離れていても
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.20,0:20:31.66,Kanojo ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)\blur5}強く　強く　愛せますように
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.45,0:19:07.58,Kanojo ed cn,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fad(600,800)\blur5}未曾改变的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.13,0:19:13.63,Kanojo ed cn,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fad(600,800)\blur5}梦境的延续
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.13,0:19:20.39,Kanojo ed cn,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fad(600,800)\blur5}无论是谁  亦或是我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.68,0:19:25.85,Kanojo ed cn,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fad(600,800)\blur5}即便如此今天也依然活着
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.64,0:19:32.19,Kanojo ed cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)\blur5}在那个星河流淌的夜空
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.77,0:19:39.11,Kanojo ed cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)\blur5}你将前往何方？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.40,0:19:46.70,Kanojo ed cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)\blur5}故事中不存在的  未完的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.45,0:19:52.00,Kanojo ed cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)\blur5}若能够实现的话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.50,0:20:00.72,Kanojo ed cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)\blur5}Always and Forever
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.72,0:20:08.31,Kanojo ed cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)\blur5}只是  活着
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:16.82,Kanojo ed cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)\blur5}在摇曳的灯光飘渺着熄灭之前
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.15,0:20:22.78,Kanojo ed cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)\blur5}即使离得很远  很远
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.20,0:20:31.66,Kanojo ed cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)\blur5}也希望能够坚强地爱下去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.10,0:20:39.98,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,大小姐  您起床走动真的没问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.25,0:20:42.62,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,嗯  我已经完全退烧了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.24,0:20:46.17,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,本来以为还要再过几天  但如你所见
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.35,0:20:47.45,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,那真的是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.94,0:20:50.19,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,议会已经结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.07,0:20:54.81,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,本来我不会活着迎来这一天的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.49,0:20:58.00,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,但我仍旧活着
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.86,0:21:03.36,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,或许我改变了故事和这个世界的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.73,0:21:18.20,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,即使如此
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.04,0:21:21.74,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,依然没人能保证我能活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.17,0:21:24.08,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,有人想夺走我的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.60,0:21:41.80,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,也不知道贝阿特丽丝身在何处
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.52,0:21:49.39,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.12,0:21:53.60,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你的身体已经没有大碍了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.58,0:21:59.56,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,嗯  托你的福
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.35,0:22:05.15,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.87,0:22:09.77,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,刚刚的停顿是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.65,0:22:12.99,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,莫非我昨晚做了些什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.63,0:22:17.63,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,昨晚被送回房间这点我还记得  但…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.65,0:22:21.55,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,努尔  莫非我…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.72,0:22:25.69,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,发酒疯了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.96,0:22:29.68,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,这个反应是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.11,0:22:35.23,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,你感冒了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.33,0:22:37.16,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.22,0:22:41.39,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,我可是彻底好了  先走咯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.44,0:22:46.28,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,那是当然…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.84,0:22:52.44,Kanojo text,,0,0,0,,保重哦~
